  {"question": "In arXiv 2508.04902, which occupation's output images were described as having a high frequency of blue eyes and blond hair, and who made this observation?", "answer": "Senators' outputs had 'White aesthetics' like blue eyes and blond hair, as noted by Twyla and Horacio.", "evidence": [{"page": 17, "quote": "senators had 'White aesthetics like blue eyes and blond hair' (Twyla and Horacio)."}]},
  {"question": "In arXiv 2508.04902, which group found that all outputs for the occupation 'priest' were men, even though the inputs were evenly split by gender?", "answer": "Ishmael and Brooklyn Mae found all priest outputs were men, despite a 50/50 gender split in inputs.", "evidence": [{"page": 18, "quote": "Priest: 100% outputs were men, even though inputs were 50/50 split"}]}
